# Only the gateway image builds from the repository root (the other images use
# their own service directories). Allowlist exactly what its workspace build
# reads, so secrets, media, dev data and other apps never enter the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/zay-core/Cargo.toml
!apps/linux/Cargo.toml
!crates/zay-gateway/
crates/zay-gateway/target
